      "id": "claim_043e2dd7391147bd8f414394a43b5bdb",
      "statement": "`oci-api` exposes two authentication modes through `AuthMode`: `ApiKey` and `InstancePrincipal`, and `Oci::from_env()` chooses between `from_api_key_env()` and `from_instance_principal_env()` after resolving the mode.",
